{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROMOTION BADGE (custom vcollect)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The compact face of the promotion relay: one line telling the shopper a live promotion covers this product, on the
surfaces too small for the full panel of snippets/custom-promotions.liquid (product cards, the home page banner).

Same data, same rules as the panel: Liquid cannot read Shopify discounts, so this reads the `vcollect_promotion`
metaobject entries kept in step by migrations/sync-promotions.mjs, and compares the dates at render time. The badge
therefore appears and drops off on its own when the promotion starts and ends, and comes back if it is re-enabled,
with nothing to redeploy.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the product whose eligibility is tested
* style: 'card' (default) renders a theme badge pill for product cards; 'banner' renders the larger chip used by
  the home page banner carousel, carrying the promotion title and its code.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Same rule as the product page panel: a sold-out product cannot be bought, so a discount on it is a tease.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.available -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign now_timestamp = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0
    assign live_promotion = nil

    for promotion in metaobjects.vcollect_promotion.values
      unless promotion.afficher_sur_fiche.value
        continue
      endunless

      comment
        A blank start means "already running", a blank end means "no end date": an empty field must never hide a
        promotion the merchant deliberately flagged.
      endcomment
      assign starts_at = promotion.date_debut.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if starts_at > now_timestamp
        continue
      endif

      assign ends_at = promotion.date_fin.value | date: '%s' | plus: 0
      if ends_at > 0 and ends_at <= now_timestamp
        continue
      endif

      assign is_eligible = false

      case promotion.portee.value
        when 'collections'
          for promotion_collection in promotion.collections.value
            for product_collection in product.collections
              if product_collection.id == promotion_collection.id
                assign is_eligible = true
                break
              endif
            endfor

            if is_eligible
              break
            endif
          endfor
        when 'produits'
          for promotion_product in promotion.produits.value
            if promotion_product.id == product.id
              assign is_eligible = true
              break
            endif
          endfor
        else
          assign is_eligible = true
      endcase

      comment
        One badge only: a second promotion would halve the impact of both on a surface this small.
      endcomment
      if is_eligible
        assign live_promotion = promotion
        break
      endif
    endfor
  -%}

  {%- if live_promotion -%}
    {%- liquid
      comment
        The saving as the shopper will read it: "10 %" for a percentage, "20 €" for a per-item amount, stored in
        cents so the money filter formats it in the store currency.
      endcomment
      assign saving_label = ''
      if live_promotion.pourcentage.value > 0
        assign saving_label = live_promotion.pourcentage.value | append: ' %'
      elsif live_promotion.montant.value > 0
        assign saving_label = live_promotion.montant.value | money_without_trailing_zeros
      endif
    -%}

    {%- if style == 'banner' -%}
      <span class="custom-promo-chip">
        <span>{{ live_promotion.titre.value | escape }}</span>
        {%- if live_promotion.code.value != blank -%}
          <b>{{ 'product.promotions.banner_code' | t: code: live_promotion.code.value }}</b>
        {%- endif -%}
      </span>
    {%- elsif saving_label != blank -%}
      <span class="badge custom-promo-badge">{{ 'product.promotions.badge_label' | t: value: saving_label }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
